        "Tens: {a2} + {b2} + {e2}{c1 > 0 ? ' + ' : ''}{c1 > 0 ? fmt(c1) : ''} = {t}{c2 > 0 ? ', write ' : ''}{c2 > 0 ? fmt(t % 10) : ''}{c2 > 0 ? ', carry ' : ''}{c2 > 0 ? fmt(c2) : ''}",
