          "value": "c1 + c2 > 0 ? s1 % 10 + 10 * ((a2 + b2 + e2) % 10) + 100 * (a3 + b3 + e3) : -1",
          "error": "forgot-to-carry",
          "feedback": "{value} forgets to carry. When a column adds to 10 or more, write the ones and carry the tens to the next column."
